        {
          "id": "GH-10-K03-check-q1",
          "type": "single",
          "question": "设映射 F(x,y)=(x²+y,xy)。按‘行对应输出分量、列对应输入变量’的约定，它的 Jacobian 矩阵是哪一个？",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "A",
              "label": "[[2x,1],[y,x]]"
            },
            {
              "value": "B",
              "label": "[[2x,y],[1,x]]"
            },
            {
              "value": "C",
              "label": "[[x²+y,xy],[2x,1]]"
            },
            {
              "value": "D",
              "label": "[[2x,1],[x,y]]"
            }
          ],
          "answer": [
            "A"
          ],
          "analysis": "第一行是输出分量 x²+y 对 x、y 的偏导，得到 (2x,1)；第二行是输出分量 xy 对 x、y 的偏导，得到 (y,x)。因此 Jacobian 为 [[2x,1],[y,x]]，选 A。",
          "points": 10,
          "knowledgePointIds": [
